# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) or pass as environment variables. Restart the dev server after changing.
#
# Where the data comes from: "mock" (default, simulated telemetry + demo controls) or "live" (the running stack).
VITE_DASHBOARD_SOURCE=mock
# Live mode: base URL of the Evidence Collector API as the browser sees it. The Vite dev server proxies this path to
# EVIDENCE_API_TARGET, because the collector sends no CORS headers.
VITE_EVIDENCE_API_BASE=/evidence-api
# EVIDENCE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:8082
